/* Purpose:
   Consume one listener-collection-19 trace-inactive descriptor for the addressed battle character.
   
   Parameters:
   pContext - unused callback context.
   pDescriptor - source player index plus normalized trace-parts ID.
   
   Algorithm:
   Resolve BattleManager, validate the source-player index, resolve character +0x458 trace manager,
   zero-initialize FTraceInactiveParam (Immediatery type), copy the descriptor parts ID only when
   trace assets are configured, then call ALuxTraceManager_Inactive_Impl.
   
   Returns:
   void.
   
   Rollback:
   This live semantic subscriber mutates retained trace lifetime/fade state and manager membership.
   Descriptor parts ID 0 closes all; IDs 1..9 close one manager slot. It must execute synchronously
   during resimulation. */

